  "scenes": [
    {
      "id": "s1",
      "name": "HOOK \u2014 network builds CLIPBACK",
      "in": 0.0,
      "out": 2.62,
      "line": "Have you heard of Clipback?"
    },
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "name": "CREATOR CONTENT ECOSYSTEM",
      "in": 2.62,
      "out": 9.4,
      "line": "Clipback is a content-focused platform designed around creator content and reward campaigns."
    },
    {
      "id": "s3",
      "name": "CREATOR FEES \u2014 flow and division",
      "in": 9.4,
      "out": 18.1,
      "line": "According to Clipback, when a coin launched through the platform generates creator fees, those fees are divided into two parts."
    },
    {
      "id": "s4",
      "name": "80 / 20 ALLOCATION",
      "in": 18.1,
      "out": 27.4,
      "line": "80% is directed toward that coin's content-reward campaign, while the remaining 20% is used to buy and burn $CLIP."
    },
    {
      "id": "s5",
      "name": "SYSTEM RECONNECTION",
      "in": 27.4,
      "out": 36.7,
      "line": "So the basic idea is to connect creator fees with content rewards, while also creating a specific mechanism involving the $CLIP token."
    },
    {
      "id": "s6",
      "name": "CLIPBACK PLATFORM",
      "in": 36.7,
      "out": 39.45,
      "line": "That's the system Clipback is building around its platform."
    },
    {
      "id": "fin",
      "name": "FINAL \u2014 $CLIP",
      "in": 39.45,
      "out": 44.0,
      "line": "$CLIP"
    }
  ],
